(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-target-go/src/main.asl#" :text "Go target entry: compileEntry! emits package main, compilePackage! a named library package.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-target-go/src/main.asl#compilePackage!" :text "Link the entry module and emit Go in the named package; exported fns get capitalised wrappers; err lists ERR_CAPABILITY_ABSENT for every builtin the runtime lacks.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-target-go/src/emit.asl#" :text "SSA to Go: values are any, each function is a for loop over a switch on its blocks, closures copy their captures at creation, every local is touched once so unused locals compile.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-target-go/src/runtime.asl#" :text "The Go runtime embedded in every emitted file, generated from a Go source: values, int64 overflow traps, floored division, host-identical printing and float formatting, builtins and entries.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-target-go/tests/ssaGoTest.asl#" :text "Builds the asl-target-js fixtures with go and compares them with asl-host run, and asl-html's suites with asl-host test.")
